===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰelǵʰ-|*bʰel-|id2=blow}}
{{inh+|en|enm|bely}}, {{m|enm|beli}}, {{m|enm|bali}}, {{m|enm|below}}, {{m|enm|belew}}, {{m|enm|balyw}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bielġ|t=bag, pouch, bulge}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*balgi}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*balgu}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*balgiz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*balguz|t=skin, hide, bellows, bag}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰelǵʰ-|t=to swell, blow up}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|balg}}, {{cog|de|Balg}}, {{cog|da|bælg}}, {{cog|sga|bolg}}, {{cog|cy|bol}}. {{doublet|en|bellows|blague|bulge|budge}}. See also {{m|en|bellows}}.

